{
  "lifecycles": [
    {
      "id": "security-secretsmanager-writes",
      "service": "security/secretsmanager",
      "enabled": true,
      "_note": "Secrets Manager lifecycle targeting all 12 write endpoints. READ endpoints (listsecretsmanager, listversion, showsecretsmanager) are covered by smoke + read-chain probes. WRITE endpoints covered here: createsecretsmanager (POST /v1/secrets), createsecretsmanagerkmskey (POST /v1/secrets/kms-key), generaterandompassword (POST /v1/secrets/random-password), deletesecretsmanager (DELETE /v1/secrets/{secret_id}), showsecretsmanagersecretvalue (POST /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/values), setkmsid (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/kmsid), setsecretdescription (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/description), setsecretaclcidr (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/acl-cidr), setprivateacl (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/private-acl), updatesecretsmanagersecretvalue (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/values), setsecretsmanagerlabel (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/label), restoresecretsmanager (PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/restore). version_list items are bare version_id strings (response_example shows version_list:['']). private_acl_enabled is STRING 'false'. secret_value is a JSON STRING. The list-versions step uses $.version_list[0] (string capture, not object). CONFIRMED 2026-06-23: acl_cidr prefix must be /25 or longer (API rejects /8 etc.). Use 146.148.42.0/25 so test runner IP 146.148.42.91 is in-range for reveal-value. set-label: use custom label 'v1tag' not system labels CURRENT/PREVIOUS (system labels require both move_to_version_id AND remove_from_version_id). createsecretsmanagerkmskey POST /v1/secrets/kms-key: STEP REMOVED 2026-07-16 (soft-4xx 원인규명 캠페인) — 2026-07 버전업에서 엔드포인트가 카탈로그/문서 nav에서 공식 삭제됨 (SPEC-DIFF-20260715.md §2⑩, 카탈로그 1,416개에 부재; 종전에도 라이브 404 NotFound 미라우팅으로 knowledge/services.md:1414 기록). 대체 경로 없음 — kms 연결은 setkmsid(PUT /v1/secrets/{secret_id}/kmsid, 본 lifecycle set-kmsid 스텝)가 커버. 2026-06-20: added setsecretdescription, setsecretaclcidr, setprivateacl, updatesecretsmanagersecretvalue, setsecretsmanagerlabel. 2026-06-23: fixed acl_cidr to 146.148.42.0/25 and label to v1tag (custom) for 2xx coverage.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "create-kms",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/kms/transit",
          "service": "kms",
          "json": {
            "auto_rotate": "Y",
            "description": "API regression suite",
            "key_type": "advanced",
            "name": "regrswkms{unique}",
            "purpose": "rsa-2048",
            "rotate_cycle": 7,
            "tags": []
          },
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202],
          "capture": {"kms_id": "$.key.id"},
          "cleanup": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "path": "/v1/kms/transit/{kms_id}",
            "service": "kms"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "random-password",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/random-password",
          "group": "xcov-sm-random-password",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {
            "exclude_characters": "abcdefg",
            "exclude_lowercase": "false",
            "exclude_numbers": "false",
            "exclude_punctuation": "false",
            "exclude_uppercase": "false",
            "include_space": "false",
            "password_length": 32,
            "require_each_included_type": "true"
          },
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "create",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/secrets",
          "wait": 15,
          "json": {
            "acl_cidr": "146.148.42.0/25,203.244.212.0/24",
            "description": "API regression suite",
            "kms_id": "{kms_id}",
            "name": "regrsecw{unique}",
            "private_acl_enabled": "false",
            "private_acl_resources": [],
            "secret_value": "{\"k\":\"v\"}",
            "tags": []
          },
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202],
          "capture": {"secret_id": "$.secret.id"},
          "cleanup": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}",
            "service": "secretsmanager",
            "json": {"waiting_time_ndays": 7}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "list",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/secrets",
          "expect_status": [200],
          "_note": "2026-07-08 DEDUP 이관(owner GO, DEDUP-AUDIT-2026-07-08): security-secretsmanager-secret 은퇴분 (listsecrets)."
        },
        {
          "name": "get",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}",
          "expect_status": [200]
        },
        {
          "name": "reveal-value",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/values",
          "group": "xcov-sm-reveal-value",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"label": "CURRENT"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "set-kmsid",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/kmsid",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-kmsid",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"kms_id": "{kms_id}"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "set-description",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/description",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-description",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"description": "API regression suite updated"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "set-acl-cidr",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/acl-cidr",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-acl-cidr",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"acl_cidr": "146.148.42.0/25,203.244.212.0/24"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "set-private-acl",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/private-acl",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-private-acl",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"private_acl_enabled": "false", "private_acl_resources": []},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "update-secret-value",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/values",
          "group": "xcov-sm-update-value",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"secret_value": "{\"k\":\"v2\"}"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "list-versions",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/versions",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-label",
          "optional": true,
          "expect_status": [200, 400, 403, 404],
          "capture": {"version_id": "$.version_list[0].version_id"}
        },
        {
          "name": "set-label",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/label",
          "group": "xcov-sm-set-label",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"label": "v1tag", "move_to_version_id": "{version_id}"},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "probe-reads",
          "probe_reads": {"secret_id": "{secret_id}"}
        },
        {
          "name": "soft-delete",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "DELETE",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}",
          "group": "xcov-sm-restore",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {"waiting_time_ndays": 7},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 204, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422],
          "destructive": true
        },
        {
          "name": "restore",
          "service": "secretsmanager",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}/restore",
          "group": "xcov-sm-restore",
          "optional": true,
          "json": {},
          "expect_status": [200, 201, 202, 400, 403, 404, 409, 422]
        },
        {
          "name": "delete",
          "method": "DELETE",
          "path": "/v1/secrets/{secret_id}",
          "json": {"waiting_time_ndays": 7},
          "expect_status": [200, 202, 204, 400, 404, 409],
          "destructive": true
        },
        {
          "name": "delete-kms",
          "method": "DELETE",
          "path": "/v1/kms/transit/{kms_id}",
          "service": "kms",
          "expect_status": [200, 202, 204],
          "destructive": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
